|cff26a6e0Player Red can use following commands:

|cffffff00-clear|r
Kills all enemies in a wave (use if mobs go into hiding).

|cffffff00-continue|r
Skips the reward dialogue for all players, if players take too long to choose

|cffffff00-kick <playername / playernumber / playercolor>|r
Removes a player from the game.
}

