STRING 6737
{
|cffffff00SLASH|r: Survival, Lots of Added Stuff, and Heroes
This |cffffff00alter |rof Overclocked's Test of Balance was created by Eaglendia. Its goal is to broaden the available space of player expression, increasing build diversity and run diversity |cffffff00without changing the core gameplay.|r 

It is built on ToB v1.25, as later versions protected the map and added cheats. It will remain open source forever. Contact Eaglendia#1485 or at Hive Workshop with issues.

|cffffff00Major changes:|r
New |cffffff00heroes |rhave been added.
All |cffffff00heroes |rhave a unique innate ability.
Additionally, most melee heroes have some form of |cffffff00armor penetration|r.
|cffffff00New items|r have been added.
|cffffff00Mirror Image|r (ability) is improved.
The game ends earlier, and enemies scale|cffffff00 faster and more aggressively.|r
}

