STRING 19075
// Abilities: A0FC (Volcano G), Ubertip (Tooltip - Normal - Extended)
{
Causes the ground to erupt into a massive Volcano. Every 3 seconds, a wave of molten rocks is hurled from the Volcano at nearby ground units and buildings, causing 300 damage to each target and stunning it for 2 seconds, 1 second versus heroes.
}

